{"id":"vod_sn_38644","vodId":"38644","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"团子大家族第一季","name_cn":"团子大家族第一季","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/69f3a93335ec10e2b071b778bb65f9bc.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一个小镇上，冈崎朋也（中村悠一 配音）是光坂高中在校生，因为家庭原因他一直过着浑浑噩噩的生活。他不参加任何社团活动，唯一的朋友是春原阳平（阪口大助 配音）。　　某天的上学途中，在樱花飞舞的坡道上，他邂逅了一名少女——古河渚（中原麻衣 配音），从此他的生活发生改变。渚因病休学一年，重返校园的她对周围环境感到相当不适应。她想加入戏剧部，然而戏剧部早已休部。朋也决定帮助她一起开展戏剧部的活动，二人关系变得越发亲密。随后不久朋也在图书馆中结识了一名天才少女一之濑琴美（能登麻美子 配音）。　　《CLANNAD》是京都动画根据Key社同名游戏改编的TV版动画作品，动画以游戏原作的古河渚线为主要剧情，并穿插其他女主角的相关剧情。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:03:20","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BK5c5KJa1U1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qmTK1JSCDY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MVrz3KdXjC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9EEiS5pEqH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mQtG02jY7z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ESzzHeZ9Mb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uNyfXKwaPQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZCBFTeGUC11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HpaXcWriCJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5L13R7ZMuf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7mx44k0vyD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZaqG864gLs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MqFm1csvMb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eH9yc2bPx